    "title": "Butte County drug bust nets 6,689 plants, 4 guns and fentanyl - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Robert Sheridan ,\n4 hours ago CHICO, Calif. — The Butte Interagency Narcotics Task Force and the Special Enforcement Unit of the Butte County Sheriff's Office participated in a regional drug enforcement operation that resulted in multiple arrests and significant seizures across Butte County. The three-day surge, called Operation Central Valley Blues, combined 38 federal, state and local agencies across 14 counties. Read full article\n4",
